Hand write a shopping list in a fast and easy way.

Features: 
- choose the color and size of the brush; 
- add a new product in the list; 
- edit the name of the product (tap on the row); 
- change the position of the product into the list (long press on the row);
- change the height of the row;
- select/deselect the product;
- delete the product from the list once you have bought; 
- share the shopping list.
